# ---------------- _artifacts/local-docker-oracle/ 세분화 (2026-05-30) ----------------
# 스크립트(.ps1/.sh) / 룰 SQL(.sql) / 컬럼 메타(.tsv) / README(.md) / docker-compose.yml
# 은 git track 함 — 다른 PC 에서도 환경 재구성 필요.
# 산출물 (로그/임시/자동 생성 폴더) 만 ignore.
# 비밀번호 `!SCMroqkf2026` 는 로컬 한정 (docker-compose.yml 주석 참조).
_artifacts/local-docker-oracle/*.log
_artifacts/local-docker-oracle/*_run.log
_artifacts/local-docker-oracle/*.bad
_artifacts/local-docker-oracle/*.discard
_artifacts/local-docker-oracle/*.dmp
_artifacts/local-docker-oracle/*.bak.*
_artifacts/local-docker-oracle/bulk_load_csv.resume.txt
_artifacts/local-docker-oracle/last-pids.json
_artifacts/local-docker-oracle/.start-all-fe.out*
_artifacts/local-docker-oracle/start-all_be.out*
_artifacts/local-docker-oracle/ctl/
_artifacts/local-docker-oracle/csv_fixed/
_artifacts/local-docker-oracle/ddl_fixed/
_artifacts/local-docker-oracle/ddl_logs/
_artifacts/local-docker-oracle/ddl_logs_fixed/
# 사내 Oracle 적용 timestamped log archive (apply.sh 산출, 누적되므로 git 제외)
_artifacts/_apply_corporate/_logs/
# 작업 중 일시 dump / 정리 SQL — git track X (To-be_v2_converted 에 정식 버전 존재)
_artifacts/local-docker-oracle/logs_*.txt
_artifacts/local-docker-oracle/compile_log.txt
_artifacts/local-docker-oracle/pkg_*.txt
_artifacts/local-docker-oracle/pkg_*.sql
